hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"129","Muhammad bin Salaam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abda ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Ubaidullah se, unhon ne Saeed bin Abi Saeed se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se poocha gaya: logon mein sab se zyada izzat wala kaun hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek un mein sab se zyada izzat wala woh hai jo un mein sab se zyada muttaqi hai, unhon ne kaha: hum Aap se is ke baare mein nahi pooch rahe, Aap ne farmaya: to logon mein sab se zyada izzat wale Hazrat Yusuf hain jo Allah ke Nabi hain jo Allah ke Nabi ke bete hain jo Allah ke Khaleel ke bete hain, unhon ne kaha: hum Aap se is ke baare mein nahi pooch rahe, Aap ne farmaya: to kya tum mujh se Arab ke maadanon ke baare mein poochte ho, unhon ne kaha: haan, Aap ne farmaya: to jahiliyyat mein tumhare behtareen log Islam mein bhi tumhare behtareen log hain jab woh deen ki samajh hasil kar lein."
"130","Al-Humaidi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salim bin Abi Hafsa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Munzir Sauri se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ali bin Hanafiyya se: kya ehsaan ka badla ehsaan ke siwa kuch aur hai, unhon ne kaha: yeh nekokaar aur badkaar dono ke liye teh shuda hai."
"131","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Thaur bin Zaid se, unhon ne Abul Ghais se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: bewa aur miskeenon par mehnat karne wala Allah ki raah mein jihad karne wale ki tarah hai aur us shakhs ki tarah hai jo din mein roza rakhta hai aur raat mein qiyam karta hai."
"132","Abul Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuaib ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abi Bakr ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke Urwa bin Zubair ne unhein khabar di, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja Hazrat Aisha ne kaha: mere paas ek aurat aayi jis ke saath us ki do betiyan thin, to us ne mujh se sawal kiya to us ne mere paas ek khajoor ke siwa kuch na paya, to main ne use woh de di, to us ne use apni dono betiyon ke darmiyan taqseem kar diya, phir woh khadi hui aur chali gayi, phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam dakhil hue to main ne un se yeh baat bayan ki, to unhon ne farmaya: jo shakhs in betiyon mein se kisi cheez ka zimmedar bane phir un se husn e sulook kare to woh us ke liye aag se parda ban jayengi."
"133","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Safwan se, unhon ne kaha: Unaisa ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Umm Saeed bint Murra Fihri se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se: main aur yateem ki kafalat karne wala Jannat mein in dono ki tarah honge ya is ki is se tarah, Sufyan ne wusta aur anghoothe se agli wali ungli ke baare mein shak kiya."
"134","Amr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansur ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Hasan se, ke ek yateem Hazrat Ibn Umar ke khane par hazir hua karta tha, to unhon ne ek din khana talab kiya, to unhon ne apne yateem ko talash kiya to use na paya, to woh Hazrat Ibn Umar ke farigh hone ke baad aaya, to Hazrat Ibn Umar ne us ke liye khana talab kiya, un ke paas kuch na tha, to woh us ke paas sattu aur shehad laya, to unhon ne kaha: yeh le, Allah ki qasam tera nuqsan nahi hua, Hasan kehte hain: Allah ki qasam Hazrat Ibn Umar ka nuqsan nahi hua."
"135","Abdullah bin Abdul Wahhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz bin Abi Hazim ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Sahl bin Saad se suna, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne kaha: main aur yateem ki kafalat karne wala Jannat mein is tarah honge, aur unhon ne apni dono ungliyon sabbaba aur wusta se ishara kiya."
"136","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ala bin Khalid bin Wardan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr bin Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Abdullah koi khana na khate the magar un ke dastarkhwan par yateem hota tha."
"137","Abdullah bin Usman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Abi Ayyub ne humein khabar di, unhon ne Yahya bin Abi Sulaiman se, unhon ne Ibn Abi Attab se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon mein behtareen ghar woh hai jis mein yateem ho jis se husn e sulook kiya jata ho, aur Musalmanon mein badtareen ghar woh hai jis mein yateem ho jis se bura sulook kiya jata ho, main aur yateem ki kafalat karne wala Jannat mein in dono ki tarah honge, apni dono ungliyon se ishara karte hue."
"138","Amr bin Abbas ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abdur Rahman bin Abza se suna, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Dawud ne kaha: yateem ke liye narm dil baap ki tarah ban ja, aur jaan le ke jaisa tu boyega waisa hi katega, ghina ke baad faqr kya hi bura hai, aur us se zyada ya us se zyada bura hidayat ke baad gumrahi hai, aur jab tu apne saathi se wada kare to us se jo wada kiya hai use poora kar, pas agar tu aisa na kare to tere aur us ke darmiyan dushmani paida hogi, aur Allah ki panah maang aise saathi se ke agar tu zikr kare to teri madad na kare aur agar tu bhool jaye to tujhe yaad na dilaye."
"139","Najih Abu Umara ne kaha: main ne Hasan ko kehte hue suna: main ne Musalmanon ka zamana paya hai aur un mein se aadmi subah karta to kehta: ae mere ghar walon ae mere ghar walon apne yateem ka khayal rakho apne yateem ka khayal rakho, ae mere ghar walon ae mere ghar walon apne miskeen ka khayal rakho apne miskeen ka khayal rakho, ae mere ghar walon ae mere ghar walon apne padosi ka khayal rakho apne padosi ka khayal rakho, aur tumhare behtareen log jaldi utha liye gaye aur tum har din giraawat ka shikaar ho rahe ho, aur main ne unhein kehte hue suna: aur jab tu chahe use fasiq dekhe tees hazar ke zariye aag ki taraf gehrai mein jata hua use kya hua Allah use halak kare, us ne Allah ke paas apna hissa bakri ki qeemat par bech diya, aur agar tu chahe use zaya karne wala shaitan ki raah mein bhatakta hua dekhe na use apne nafs se naseehat karne wala hai aur na logon mein se."
"140","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam bin Abi Muti ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Asma bin Ubaid se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Ibn Sireen se kaha: mere paas yateem hai, unhon ne kaha: us se waisa sulook kar jaisa apne bete se karta hai, use maar jaisa apne bete ko maarta hai."
"141","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, unho ne Nahhas bin Qahm se, unho ne Shaddad Abu Ammar se, unho ne Awf bin Malik se, unho ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se rivayat kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Main aur dono rukhsaron par siyahi liye hue aurat, wo aurat jo apne shohar se be shohar ho gayi phir us ne apni aulad par sabar kiya, Jannat mein in do ki tarah honge."
"142","Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, unho ne kaha: Shoba ne hum se bayan kiya, unho ne Shumaisa Atakiyya se rivayat kiya, unho ne kaha: Hazrat Ayesha raziyallahu anha ke pas yateem ki tadeeb ka zikr hua to unho ne farmaya: Beshak main yateem ko marti hun yahan tak ke wo khul jata hai."
